  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Cambia (diclofenac potassium powder), 50 mg packets. Source effective_date retained as 2018-01-01; PDF Version 1, Original 7/11/2018, Approval 9/21/2018.",
    "Approval requires acute migraine with or without aura, age at least 18, the NSAID and triptan steps, and no daily use. Known hypersensitivity to diclofenac, other NSAIDs or excipients is excluded. Denials mirror these requirements; the NSAID denial does not override the liquid NSAID alternative for patients unable to swallow tablets.",
    "Cautions (notes only): NSAIDs can increase the risk of cardiovascular events and gastrointestinal adverse events.",
    "Duration (notes only): initial approval up to 6 months; reauthorization approval up to 12 months.",
    "Quantity limit (notes only): 9 x 50 mg packets per month. max_units is null; quantity enforcement requires manual review.",
    "Remains partial: diagnosis, therapy history, swallowing ability, contraindication, hypersensitivity and use frequency are attestations. Evidence verification, cautions, duration, reauthorization and quantity require manual review. PDL status unknown."
  ],
